-- Replace the placeholder monthly checklist tasks with the REAL task list from
-- each QM-FM maintenance checklist workbook. Every task is prefixed with the
-- EQUIPMENT column from the sheet so each question stays linked to the item it
-- belongs to. doc_ref is set to the revision of the sheet actually imported.
-- Nothing is invented: tasks are taken verbatim from the workbooks.
-- Diamond Blender (QM-FM-039) and Generator 440 kVA (QM-FM-028) are NOT touched
-- here - see the CHANGELOG note.

